                    Papers, President’s Evening Reading September–December 1982. Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d120-f2" n="2" xml:id="d120-f2-content">
                <p>A record of the Eagleburger-Yaker conversation is in telegram 315185 to Algiers,
                    November 9. (Department of State, Central Foreign Policy File, Electronic
                    Telegrams, D820581–0857)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
